OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't afford to heat my home on
OL,4,Amy pension'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome pensioners say they are going to
OL,7,Fbed early, wearing extra layers and
OL,8,Fusing hot water bottles because they
OL,9,Fcannot afford to heat their homes this
OL,10,Fwinter.
OL,12,FTeresa Goubert, from Guernsey, who uses
OL,13,Felectric and oil heating, said: "I'm
OL,14,Ftrying to keep it off as long as
OL,15,Fpossible because it's got very
OL,16,Fexpensive and I just can't afford to do
OL,17,Fit [heat home] on my pension."
OL,19,FThe States has proposed a 19% increase
OL,20,Fin the means-tested winter fuel
OL,21,Fallowance to #50.48 a week. It will be
OL,22,Fdebated in November.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
