OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't afford to heat my home on
OL,4,Amy pension'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTina Bury, Employment and Social
OL,7,FSecurity President, said: "The fuel
OL,8,Fallowance is quite a broad brush
OL,9,Fapproach and obviously everyone's needs
OL,10,Fare different in this area."
